text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures able to block target creature this turn do so.', 'Cinder Storm deals 7 damage to any target.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target sorcery spell.', 'Counter target spell.', "Creatures and lands target opponent controls don't untap during their next untap step.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Dakmor Plague deals 3 damage to each creature and each player.', "Dakmor Sorceress's power is equal to the number of Swamps you control.", 'Destroy all creatures and lands.', 'Destroy all creatures with flying.', 'Destroy all lands.', 'Destroy all tapped creatures. You gain 2 life for each creature destroyed this way.', 'Destroy target creature. Its owner gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target land or nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature. You gain 3 life.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Destroy two target nonblack creatures. You lose 5 life.', 'Draw four cards, then discard three cards at random.', 'Draw four cards.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Fire Tempest deals 6 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Flying', "Flying\nGoblin Glider can't block.", 'Flying\nWhen Abyssal Horror enters the battlefield, target player discards two cards.', 'Flying\nWhen Angel of Mercy enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Dread Reaper enters the battlefield, you lose 5 life.', "Flying\nWhen Ingenious Thief enters the battlefield, look at target player's hand.", 'Flying\nWhen Owl Familiar enters the battlefield, draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Flying\nWhen Thunder Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Flying\nWhenever Shrieking Specter attacks, defending player discards a card.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, vigilance', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "Green creatures you control gain forestwalk until end of turn. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', "Hulking Goblin can't block.", "Hulking Ogre can't block.", "If the difference between your life total and target player's life total is 5 or less, exchange life totals with that player.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Jagged Lightning deals 3 damage to each of two target creatures.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Look at the top card of target player's library. You may put that card into their graveyard.", "Look at the top five cards of target player's library. Put any number of them on the bottom of that library in any order and the rest on top of the library in any order.", 'Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'One or two target creatures gain flying until end of turn.', "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Champion Lancer by creatures.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return two target creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Scorching Spear deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle. You lose 3 life.', 'Shuffle any number of target creature cards from your graveyard into your library.', 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Squall deals 2 damage to each creature with flying.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Sylvan Yeti's power is equal to the number of cards in your hand.", "Take an extra turn after this one. At the beginning of that turn's end step, you lose the game.", 'Tap all nonwhite creatures.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Target creature gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent draws a card.\nYou gain 7 life.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player gains 8 life.', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.', 'Target player skips all combat phases of their next turn.', 'Target player takes an extra turn after this one.', 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.', "Until end of turn, you may tap lands you don't control for mana. Spend this mana only to cast spells.", 'Vigilance', "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to any target.', 'When Dakmor Ghoul enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'When Dakmor Lancer enters the battlefield, destroy target nonblack creature.', "When Denizen of the Deep enters the battlefield, return each other creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'When Devout Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', 'When Goblin Commando enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'When Goblin Settler enters the battlefield, destroy target land.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Loyal Sentry blocks a creature, destroy that creature and Loyal Sentry.', "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Serpent Warrior enters the battlefield, you lose 3 life.', 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Whenever Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Goblin General attacks, Goblin creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Hollow Dogs attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Royal Trooper blocks, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Sylvan Basilisk becomes blocked by a creature, destroy that creature.', 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You gain 2 life for each card in your hand.', 'You gain 4 life.', "You may have Lone Wolf assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Pride of Lions assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Thorn Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", 'You may play up to three additional lands this turn.']
